5,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Since we're five now, the old system is clearly outdated. I suggest we look into the plug-in monitor readings room by room and the winter habits at a house paying ahead to see our options.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Mio,,I'm in! I want to see the trial run of a reconciliation template and the monthly settle observed at another house to see how much work it actually is.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I think it would be wise to examine the payment log for the last twelve months and the plug-in monitor readings room by room to understand our actual usage patterns.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I'll look into the last twelve utility statements and the electrician's quote for the rooms to get a sense of the costs involved.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minato,,I want to see the payment log for the last twelve months and the kitchen notice about the cooler to see how everyone feels.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"It seems we have a good spread of interests. @Jonathan, since we both chose the monitor readings, perhaps we can compare notes later to see if the data is consistent.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Mio,,"That sounds like a plan! @Victoria, do you think the electrician's quote will be really expensive? I'm curious if that's even a realistic option for us.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I suspect the cost might be high, but knowing the figure is better than guessing. I'm more interested in whether our current habits are truly equitable.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"I'm not sure yet, but that's why I'm checking. I also want to see the statements to understand how much the bills fluctuate throughout the year before we commit.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minato,,"I hope that by looking at the payment log and the cooler notice, we can find a way to stop arguing about money and just be happy together.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"I agree with Minato. A system that reduces friction is just as important as one that is mathematically precise. I'm curious if the ""paying ahead"" model helps with that.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Mio,,"Exactly! If we can find a way to make it simple, maybe we won't have to spend so much time worrying about it every single month.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I agree. Simplicity often leads to peace. I'm hopeful that the payment log will reveal if our current frustrations are based on facts or just perceptions.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"I agree. Having a clear picture of the historical data will prevent us from making decisions based on assumptions, which is the most rational way to proceed.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Minato,,"I just want us to be kind to each other. I think looking at these things will help us understand each other better, not just the money.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"Since we've all agreed on our research, let's finalize the list. I'll stick with the monitor readings and winter habits. Is everyone satisfied with their choices before we move forward?","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Mio,,I'm totally satisfied! I can't wait to see how that template works and what the other house does. Let's do it!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I am satisfied as well. I will proceed with the payment log and the monitor readings.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Victoria,,I am satisfied. I will look into the last twelve utility statements and the electrician's quote for the rooms.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Minato,,I'm satisfied too. I'll look into the payment log and the kitchen notice. I hope we find a way to make things better for everyone.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
